WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
SPEAKER: The Associate
Cloud Engineer track

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.650
enables you to become proficient
with Google Cloud Platform

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:07.560
through hands-on
practice with Qwiklabs.

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.180
The track provides
Qwiklabs credits

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:12.360
that you can use to complete
the labs free of charge.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:15.480
Here are the steps to
redeem Qwiklabs credits.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.720
At the beginning of the
program, an invitation email

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:22.580
was sent to you from Google
Cloud EDU and Coursera,

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:23.690
and the subject line--

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:26.480
You are invited to
learn on Coursera.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:29.150
The email provides the link
to redeem Qwiklabs credits

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.750
and the access code.

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:33.820
The link in the invitation
email will directly

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:36.610
open Qwiklabs, the Google
Cloud training platform,

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:38.980
and prompt you for
the access code.

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:41.710
Here are the steps
using an example.

00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:45.610
Click the invitation link,
copy and paste the access code

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:48.750
as prompted, and click Submit.

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:51.970
Sign into your Qwiklabs account.

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:56.390
Click on Join with Email to
set up your Qwiklabs account.

00:00:56.390 --> 00:00:58.850
Set up your Qwiklabs account.

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:02.480
Enter your first name, last
name, and your email address.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:04.430
Specify the same
email address that you

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:07.030
use for your Coursera account.

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:11.590
For Company Name, specify your
institution's name or none.

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:13.390
Enter password.

00:01:13.390 --> 00:01:15.820
Enable the opt-in box
to receive information

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:17.770
about new content
and special discounts

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:20.950
after you complete the
Cloud Architecture quest.

00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:24.750
Enable CAPTCHA, and click
Create a New Account.

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.688
Once you have created
your Qwiklabs account,

00:01:26.688 --> 00:01:28.230
you may verify that
credits have been

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:31.030
added to your Qwiklabs account.

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:33.630
Click on the User Profile to
review your Qwiklabs credit

00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:35.690
status.

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:37.540
Click on the User Profile.

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:40.540
Within your User Profile,
click My Account,

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:42.460
and click on Credits
&amp; Subscriptions

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:45.890
for additional Qwiklabs
account information.

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:48.510
Redeeming Qwiklabs credits for
the Associate Cloud Engineer

00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:52.350
track is a one-time process.

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:54.150
If you already have
a Qwiklabs account

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:56.970
and enrolled in the Cloud
Architecture quest before,

00:01:56.970 --> 00:01:59.280
please un-enroll in the
quest and then click

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:01.140
the Enroll button again.

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:02.730
Only when you click
the Enroll button

00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:05.620
will the credits be
applied to your account.

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:10.199
If there are any other problems,
email support@qwiklabs.com.

00:02:10.199 --> 00:02:13.200
The team will respond quickly.

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:17.190
We have now reviewed the steps
to redeem Qwiklabs credits,

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:20.670
create your account, verify
that Qwiklabs credits have been

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:25.370
added to your account, and
that support@qwiklabs.com

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:28.990
is your resource for
troubleshooting assistance.

